# Openable chat links

Do not wrap Windows absolute paths (`c:\dev\...`) in markdown `[]()`. Backslashes break the link.

## Files

- Workspace-relative, forward slashes: `.context/sessions/…/experiments.md`
- Or a fenced path: `` `.context/sessions/…/experiments.md` ``
- Code citations only as ` ```start:end:path ` (required format)

## Agents

- `[Short name](agent-id)` — id only, no `.jsonl`, no `file://`

## Never

- `c:\…` or `C:\…` inside `[]()`
- `file:///C:/…` unless the user asked for an OS path
